  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a June 2025 official statement, David Peters said he shared concern about potential unlawful transshipment or re-export of sensitive technologies to adversaries and noted that ECRA proscribes such conduct. In the same statement, he committed, if confirmed, to vigorous and fair enforcement and to consider the full range of penalties available under ECRA and the EAR where appropriate. In February 2026, he described chip smuggling as ongoing and among top enforcement priorities, and pointed to recent indictments and arrests involving smuggling and unlicensed exports of advanced AI chips and GPUs.",
   "sids": [
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s1",
    "s4"
   ],
   "sentences": [
